OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 4 JAN
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy serves up a sonic cocktail
OL,6,     Gto soundtrack your Sunday
OL,7,     Gafternoon. He kicks of 2026 with
OL,8,     Gthe likes of GFOTY, Swans, Baxter
OL,9,     GDury, Jenny Hval and a track
OL,10,     Gabout Augustus Caesar.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GWith a borderless spectrum of
OL,13,     Gmusic, new experiments in
OL,14,     GStorytelling and sound.
OL,15,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,16,     GStuart's featured album is
OL,17,     GTangerine Dream's Rubycon, which
OL,18,     Gjust been given a deluxe reissue
OL,19,     Gto mark its 50th anniversary.
